### QR 결제
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/qr
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "cardId": 1,
  "amount": 15000,
  "merchantId": 1,
  "merchantName": "편의점 GS25",
  "merchantCategoryCode": "5411",
  "purpose": "PERSONAL"
}

### QR 토큰 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/qr/token
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "cardId": 1,
  "amount": 25000,
  "merchantId": 2,
  "merchantName": "교보문고 광화문점",
  "merchantCategoryCode": "5942",
  "purpose": "BUSINESS"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("qrToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### QR 토큰 결제 정보 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/qr/token/{{qrToken}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### QR 토큰 결제 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/qr/token/{{qrToken}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### QR 토큰 결제 상태 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/qr/token/{{qrToken}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
